<div class="page-body is-centered">

    <p>Hello, my name is Clint. I'm a software engineer and run <a href="https://parkasoftware.com">Parka Software</a>, a boutique software consulting company. I live in Minneapolis, Minnesota. I've been making software on the Microsoft stack since 2000.</p>

<p>I write about technology, coffee and a handful of side projects that I've got going on.</p>

<p>Aside from my day job, I brew Chemex pour overs and take pictures of the city with my Ricoh GRIIIx, which end up at <a href="https://photos.clintmcmahon.com">photos.clintmcmahon.com</a>. I'm still trying to figure out a perfect espresso.</p>

<p>If something I wrote was helpful, email me at <a href="mailto:clintmcmahon@pm.me">clintmcmahon@pm.me</a>. Same if you want to talk about coffee, photography or just to say hello. I love it when people email me about something I wrote.</p>

